      "s": "Bloomberg Tech",
      "t": "Tesla Reveals Flying Roadster Built With SpaceX Tech",
      "d": "Elon Musk reveals a new prototype of Tesla's Roadster sports car at a SpaceX facility in Texas. The car includes air thrusters which can launch the vehicle into the sky. Musk showed off this capability at the event. The car won't go into production until 2028. Musk says this shows what can happen when his companies work together. Bloomberg's Craig Trudell reports.  (Source: Bloomberg)",
