    {
      "s": "Bloomberg Tech",
      "t": "Tesla Unveils Roadster With a Nod to SpaceX Merger",
      "d": "Tesla shares rose in premarket trading Friday morning after Elon Musk unveiled \nits long-delayed Roadster sports car that includes air thrusters. The car actually launched into the sky during an event at a SpaceX rocket facility in Texas. Musk has been signaling he may try to combine the companies. Matthew Bloxham of Bloomberg Intelligence has more. (Source: Bloomberg)",
